      "originalText": "映射公式 (ldmatrix.m8n8.x1 非转置):\n  row       = thread_id / 4\n  col_start = (thread_id % 4) * 2\n  reg[u32]  = {mat[row][col_start], mat[row][col_start+1]}",
      "autoResize": false,
