      "text": "SM80_16x8x16 A操作数 TV Layout",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SM80_16x8x16 A操作数 TV Layout",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tv_code",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 766,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 355,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 4102,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ALayout: (T32, V8) → (M16, K16)\n\nLayout<\n  Shape <Shape<_4,_8>, Shape<_2,_2,_2>>,\n  Stride<Stride<_32,_1>,Stride<_16,_8,_128>>\n>\n\n解读:\n Thread = t_outer(4) * 8 + t_inner(8)\n   t_inner stride=1  → K方向连续\n   t_outer stride=32 → M方向跳2行\n\n Value = v2(2)*4 + v1(2)*2 + v0(2)\n   v0 stride=16  → M方向+1行\n   v1 stride=8   → K方向+8列(后半段)\n   v2 stride=128 → M方向+8行(下半段)\n\nThread 0 持有 (16×16矩阵中):\n v0:(0,0)  v1:(1,0)  → d0寄存器\n v2:(0,8)  v3:(1,8)  → d1寄存器\n v4:(8,0)  v5:(9,0)  → d2寄存器\n v6:(8,8)  v7:(9,8)  → d3寄存器",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ALayout: (T32, V8) → (M16, K16)\n\nLayout<\n  Shape <Shape<_4,_8>, Shape<_2,_2,_2>>,\n  Stride<Stride<_32,_1>,Stride<_16,_8,_128>>\n>\n\n解读:\n Thread = t_outer(4) * 8 + t_inner(8)\n   t_inner stride=1  → K方向连续\n   t_outer stride=32 → M方向跳2行\n\n Value = v2(2)*4 + v1(2)*2 + v0(2)\n   v0 stride=16  → M方向+1行\n   v1 stride=8   → K方向+8列(后半段)\n   v2 stride=128 → M方向+8行(下半段)\n\nThread 0 持有 (16×16矩阵中):\n v0:(0,0)  v1:(1,0)  → d0寄存器\n v2:(0,8)  v3:(1,8)  → d1寄存器\n v4:(8,0)  v5:(9,0)  → d2寄存器\n v6:(8,8)  v7:(9,8)  → d3寄存器",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

