      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "对应 CuTe 代码:\n  using TiledMMA   = TiledMMA<MMA_Atom<SM80_16x8x16_F32F16F16F32_TN>>;\n  auto copy_A      = make_tiled_copy_A(Copy_Atom<SM75_U16x4_LDSM_T, half_t>{}, tiled_mma);  // A: ldmatrix.trans (行主序SMEM → 列消费)\n  auto copy_B      = make_tiled_copy_B(Copy_Atom<SM75_U32x4_LDSM_N, half_t>{}, tiled_mma);  // B: ldmatrix.normal (行主序SMEM → 行消费)\n  cute::copy(copy_A, thr_copy.partition_S(sA), thr_copy.partition_D(rA));  // 底层发射 ldmatrix PTX\n  cute::gemm(tiled_mma, rA, rB, rC);                                       // 底层发射 mma.sync PTX",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "对应 CuTe 代码:\n  using TiledMMA   = TiledMMA<MMA_Atom<SM80_16x8x16_F32F16F16F32_TN>>;\n  auto copy_A      = make_tiled_copy_A(Copy_Atom<SM75_U16x4_LDSM_T, half_t>{}, tiled_mma);  // A: ldmatrix.trans (行主序SMEM → 列消费)\n  auto copy_B      = make_tiled_copy_B(Copy_Atom<SM75_U32x4_LDSM_N, half_t>{}, tiled_mma);  // B: ldmatrix.normal (行主序SMEM → 行消费)\n  cute::copy(copy_A, thr_copy.partition_S(sA), thr_copy.partition_D(rA));  // 底层发射 ldmatrix PTX\n  cute::gemm(tiled_mma, rA, rB, rC);                                       // 底层发射 mma.sync PTX",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
